    "blocks": [
      {
        "id": "p1",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "Many people don’t like getting up early in the morning, but most of us have to get out of bed to make money. What if you could get paid without leaving your bed? Well, a group of 12 volunteers has just done exactly that."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p2",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "All the volunteers were between the ages of 20 and 45. They spent two full months in a special lab in France. There they stayed in bed 24 hours a day for 60 days without any "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "breaks",
            "ref": "v-break"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": ". That meant no getting up for meals, no showers, and not even getting up for bathroom breaks. They ate, read, and did everything lying down. How much were they paid for their unusual “work”? Each person received $18,300! But it’s certainly not easy money, right? Staying in bed for so long can make your body feel weak and "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "stiff",
            "zh": "僵硬的"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p3",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "These volunteers were part of an important scientific experiment. Scientists "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "conducted",
            "ref": "v-conduct"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " the study to "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "observe",
            "ref": "v-observe"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " changes to the human body during long-term bed rest. Lying down for a long time is similar to how "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "astronauts’",
            "ref": "v-astronaut"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " bodies are "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "affected",
            "ref": "v-affect"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " in space, where there is no "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "gravity",
            "ref": "v-gravity"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": ". The research may help scientists find better ways to keep astronauts healthy during long space trips. It can also help people who must stay in bed for long "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "periods",
            "ref": "v-period"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "due to",
            "ref": "v-due-to"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " illness. So, while it might sound like a simple way to earn money, these volunteers have actually helped "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "advance",
            "ref": "v-advance"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " science through their unusual effort."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "i1",
        "type": "imageRef",
        "image": "img1"
      }
    ]
  },
